        "x": 129,
        "y": 1293
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Every flower is a rose of 160 points round its place: 2 + 7 × Petals lobes, its size from the note's loudness and Bloom, its hue from the note and Hue. It grows in (a decay Envelope, turned upside down), turns at Spin, and after 24 s wilts away over 8 s (a fade Envelope). Bloom makes the garden glow.",
